[gd_scene load_steps=11 format=3]

; A WEAPON THAT HEALS, not a tool that hurts.
;
; Three things fixed from the first pass. The head was a cone on a smooth
; shaft, which read as a service wand — it is now a broad leaf blade with
; swept-back barbs behind the shoulder, so it bites going in and again coming
; out. The blade was a PrismMesh, which is flat and vanished when the camera
; caught it edge-on — it is stacked boxes now and has volume from every angle.
; And the haft was 2.6m against a 0.5m head, so the thing read as a pole with
; something on the end; the haft is shorter and the head nearly twice the size.
;
; Palette is the one the guns in use are built from. The single teal is the
; injector, kept small — teal is the repair read in this game and it should be
; a detail on a weapon, not the weapon.

